bel-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.76</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.003%<br />Mansion: 0.00001%<br />Mineshaft: 0.00001%<br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.0001%<br />Carnival: 0.00001%<br /><b>Expanded Mineshaft: 99.996%</b><br />Greenhouse: 0.00003%<br />Rubber Rooms: 0.0004%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n32</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 7</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 8</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nBunker Spider, Hygrodere, Bracken</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nEarth Leviathan, Baboon Hawk, Eyeless Dog</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n17</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n8</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n15</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Trial:_Incinarate_The_Lies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trial: Incinarate The Lies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Incinerate_The_Lies_Videotape\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Incinerate The Lies Videotape</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>A desert moon previously used for mining operations. Ownership was transferred to the Trite Control Corporation.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/File:Descenttopdown.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Descenttopdown.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Descenttopdown.png/650px-Descenttopdown.png?1b5b11\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"366\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Descenttopdown.png/975px-Descenttopdown.png?1b5b11 1.5x, /images/thumb/Descenttopdown.png/1300px-Descenttopdown.png?1b5b11 2x\" data-file-width=\"2560\" data-file-height=\"1440\" /></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Warm, sandy terrain. Commonly hit with sandstorms.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Dominated by a few species.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Descent can experience Rainy, Stormy, Foggy, Flooded, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, or Minefield weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trial:_Incinarate_The_Lies\">Trial: Incinarate The Lies</span></h3>\n<p>This moon features a <b>trial that generates with the Expanded Mineshaft interior</b>. Completing it rewards the player with scrap worth a total of at least \u25ae400. <b>The specific rewards</b> are <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span> the scrap \"Charred diamond\" and \"Incinerate the lies ticket\".</span></span>\n</p><p><big>To complete this trial:</big>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find the room with the employee in it within the interior. This room is generally near the main entrance elevator.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find and insert eight false articles into the shredder in front of the employee. They spawn on the smaller shelving units within the interior.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Press the red button in this room, wait for three symbols to appear on the screens above the employee, and remember the symbols.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find a room in the interior with multiple pipes with symbols on them and interactable valves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Turn the three valves on the pipes that have the same symbols as the ones shown previously. Turning the wrong valve will cause the player to die via blast if in close proximity, but there is a delay before the blast that allows a player to run away unscathed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Return to the room with the employee in it and press the red button again.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Interact with the red valve at the end of the room when prompted and wait. The door the employee was slid into will open and reveal the rewards afterward.</span></span></li></ol>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Inserting the \"Incinerate the lies\" videotape that randomly spawns as scrap within the interior of <a class=\"text\" href=\"https://wesleysmoons.wiki.gg/wiki/Narcotic\">Narcotic</a> into the projector in <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Extort\" title=\"Extort\"><big> <b>Extort:</b> </big></a> \"Grind the deluded\" videotape that randomly spawns as scrap within the interior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Airhorn</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Airhorn.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Airhorn.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/60px-Airhorn.png?6146f4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/90px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Airhorn.png/120px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>2.75%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big bolt</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_bolt.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big bolt.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/60px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/90px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/120px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>3.07%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bottles</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"